\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {2}{\ignorespaces Bucket attribution: literal per-bar OLS on each exogenous bucket, from the unification campaign. \textbf  {Panel:} frozen base-2 panel, diurnally adjusted, $n = 218{,}934$ thirty-minute bars, identical rows in every cell; incumbent QLIKE $0.24050$ (per-bar OLS on HAR $+$ calendar). \textbf  {Estimator:} exact OLS ($\alpha = 0$), rolling window $24{,}000$ bars ($500$ trading days), refit every bar by exact rank-one updates. Columns participate in a window only when their feed went live before the window starts and printed within it; masked columns are disclosed per chunk. $\Delta $ is against the incumbent; the within-class increment coincides with $\Delta $ because the no-exogenous design is exactly the incumbent under literal OLS.}}{12}{table.caption.11}\protected@file@percent }
